# Build artifacts

`habit-builder.zip` (one level up) is generated by `package_skill.py` from skill-creator and is for distribution. Do not commit anything in this directory to git.

```
# Re-create the package after editing:
python3 ~/.workbuddy/plugins/cache/workbuddy-builtin/skill-skill-creator/0.1.0/scripts/package_skill.py \
    /Users/xieqiufang/WorkBuddy/2026-09-20-16-09-48/habit-builder \
    /Users/xieqiufang/WorkBuddy/2026-09-20-16-09-48/
```
